%% Eraser exact-check budget witness sequence
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber

  actor User as User pointer
  participant Surface as CanvasSurface
  participant Tools as CanvasToolPort
  participant IE as InteractionEngine
  participant Cleanup as PointerToolCleanupCoordinator
  participant Preview as CanvasPreviewState
  participant Spatial as SpatialKernel
  participant Geometry as GeometryPolicy
  participant EK as EditKernel
  participant Store as DocumentStoreKernel
  participant CC as CommitCompiler
  participant Effects as CommitEffects
  participant Applier as CommitApplier
  participant SpatialApply as SpatialKernel update
  participant Projection as DocumentProjectionCache
  participant Frame as FrameEngine
  participant Events as EventBuffer
  participant BudgetProbe as Eraser budget probes non-hub
  participant Runtime as RuntimeRoot
  participant Signals as Public state/effects

  User->>Surface: eraser down/move samples
  Surface->>Tools: handlePointer(CanvasPointerInput finite samples)
  Tools->>IE: normalized finite eraser sample and finite thickness
  IE->>IE: append eraser corridor point in world coordinates
  IE->>Spatial: query erase candidates(corridor envelope inflated by eraserThickness/2 + hitPadding + 4.0)
  Spatial-->>IE: bounded candidate handles or typed budget-exceeded

  alt preview spatial budget exceeded
    IE->>Preview: publish corridor-only preview, no tentative ids
    Preview-->>Runtime: preview revision fact
    Runtime->>Signals: publish CanvasRuntimeState with updated state.revisions.preview
    Preview->>Frame: request overlay repaint for corridor only
    IE->>BudgetProbe: increment eraser preview budget-exceeded probe
    Note over EK,Signals: Preview budget exceeded produces no document mutation, selection change, spatial update, projection/cache eviction, main repaint, or erase action.
    else preview spatial candidates returned
    IE->>Geometry: preview exact checks for deletable non-background candidates(segment-to-family)
    Note over Geometry: Preview budget is 512 candidates / 4096 exact checks per sample.
    alt preview candidate/check budget exceeded
      Geometry-->>IE: preview budget exceeded
      IE->>Preview: publish corridor-only preview, no tentative ids
      Preview-->>Runtime: preview revision fact
      Runtime->>Signals: publish CanvasRuntimeState with updated state.revisions.preview
      Preview->>Frame: request overlay repaint for corridor only
      IE->>BudgetProbe: increment eraser preview budget-exceeded probe
      Note over EK,Signals: Preview budget exceeded produces no document mutation, selection change, spatial update, projection/cache eviction, main repaint, or erase action.
    else preview budget accepts
      Geometry-->>IE: tentative ids for preview only
      IE->>Preview: publish eraser preview with tentative ids
      Preview-->>Runtime: preview revision fact
      Runtime->>Signals: publish CanvasRuntimeState with updated state.revisions.preview
      Preview->>Frame: request overlay repaint
    end
  end

  User->>Surface: eraser terminal up
  Surface->>Tools: handlePointer(CanvasPointerInput finite up)
  Tools->>IE: same-token finite terminal eraser intent
  IE->>Spatial: query terminal erase candidates(corridor envelope inflated by eraserThickness/2 + hitPadding + 4.0)
  Spatial-->>IE: terminal candidate handles or typed budget-exceeded

  alt terminal spatial budget exceeded
    IE->>Cleanup: typed cleanup request for eraser no-op cleanup
        Cleanup-->>IE: PointerCleanupOutcome(overlay repaint target, preview changed)
        IE->>Preview: apply outcome: clear eraser corridor preview
    IE->>Preview: bump previewRevision for cleared active preview
    Preview->>Frame: request overlay cleanup repaint only
    IE->>BudgetProbe: increment eraser terminal budget-exceeded probe
    Preview-->>Runtime: preview cleanup revision fact
    Runtime->>Signals: publish CanvasRuntimeState with updated state.revisions.preview
    Note over Store,Signals: Terminal budget exceeded is cleanup/no-op for committed content: no partial erase, document mutation, selection mutation, spatial index mutation, projection/cache eviction, main repaint, or erase action.
  else terminal spatial candidates returned
    IE->>Geometry: terminal exact checks for deletable non-background candidates(segment-to-family)
    Note over Geometry: Terminal budget is 4096 candidates / 32768 exact checks.
    alt terminal candidate/check budget exceeded
      Geometry-->>IE: terminal budget exceeded
      IE->>Cleanup: typed cleanup request for eraser no-op cleanup
        Cleanup-->>IE: PointerCleanupOutcome(overlay repaint target, preview changed)
        IE->>Preview: apply outcome: clear eraser corridor preview
      IE->>Preview: bump previewRevision for cleared active preview
      Preview->>Frame: request overlay cleanup repaint only
      IE->>BudgetProbe: increment eraser terminal budget-exceeded probe
      Preview-->>Runtime: preview cleanup revision fact
      Runtime->>Signals: publish CanvasRuntimeState with updated state.revisions.preview
      Note over Store,Signals: Terminal budget exceeded is cleanup/no-op for committed content: no partial erase, document mutation, selection mutation, spatial index mutation, projection/cache eviction, main repaint, or erase action.
    else terminal exact ids accepted
      Geometry-->>IE: exact deletable non-background ids
      alt terminal exact ids empty
        IE->>Cleanup: typed cleanup request for eraser no-op cleanup
        Cleanup-->>IE: PointerCleanupOutcome(overlay repaint target, preview changed)
        IE->>Preview: apply outcome: clear eraser corridor preview
        IE->>Preview: bump previewRevision for cleared active preview
        Preview->>Frame: request overlay cleanup repaint only
        Preview-->>Runtime: preview cleanup revision fact
        Runtime->>Signals: publish CanvasRuntimeState with updated state.revisions.preview
        Note over Store,Signals: Empty terminal exact set is cleanup/no-op for committed content: no document mutation, selection mutation, spatial index mutation, projection/cache eviction, main repaint, or erase action.
      else terminal exact ids non-empty
        IE->>EK: open synchronous interaction edit
        EK->>Store: read committed revision snapshot
        EK->>EK: remove exact ids in rollback-safe draft, including selection cleanup
        EK->>CC: compile exact touched set and staged erase action
        Note over EK,CC: Touched scope is removed ids plus selection only if erased ids intersect selection. Revisions are document, structural, bounds, elementVisual, projection, and conditional selection.
        CC->>Effects: prepare typed main repaint and invalidation effects
        CC->>Applier: hand off compiled CommitPlan
        Applier->>Store: atomic install
        Store-->>Applier: committed revision facts
        Applier->>SpatialApply: apply touched removals only
        Applier->>Projection: evict by projectionRevision
        Applier->>Events: materialize erase action after install
        Applier->>Frame: publish committed main repaint bus
        IE->>Cleanup: typed cleanup request for eraser no-op cleanup
        Cleanup-->>IE: PointerCleanupOutcome(overlay repaint target, preview changed)
        IE->>Preview: apply outcome: clear eraser corridor preview
        IE->>Preview: bump previewRevision for cleared active preview
        Preview->>Frame: request overlay cleanup repaint
        Preview-->>Runtime: preview cleanup revision fact
        Applier-->>Runtime: committed document and selection facts
        Runtime->>Signals: publish CanvasRuntimeState after document, selection, and preview effects
        Events->>Signals: publish erase action notification
        Frame->>Signals: publish main repaint and overlay cleanup repaint
      end
    end
  end
